From fdff5436bdcdab2a310b0f77e407e8f1a4fec4f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:51:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Charger events from Home Assistant: collect
 plug/start/end/unplug with car snapshots

- charger_events table (migration 005), unique on (event, eventAt)
- receive_charger_event.php: standalone endpoint (Authentik bypass, same API key),
  strict validation (ChargerEvents), idempotent
- ChargerSessions assembles sessions: plug-in and charge start are kept apart
  (Monta delays charging 4-5 h to cheap hours), energy = the session counter just
  before it resets, stale counter after an integration reload is not reused
- api.php?action=charger-sessions
- HA automation + rest_command in docs/home-assistant-charger-events.md; rules
  verified by replaying the real 26-30 Oct history (ignores the unknown blips)
- dev/test_charger_events.php (53 checks) + fixture from real data
